      "lines": [
        "和 $b\\ne0$，即",
        "（$\\frac{a}{b}=0$）$\\Longleftrightarrow$（$a=0$ 和 $b\\ne0$）。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来说明当解方程时怎样应用分数等于零这个条件。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "下面看一些例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 解方程 $\\frac{2x-5}{3+x}=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "分式 $\\frac{2x-5}{3+x}$ 等于零，当且仅当 $x$ 的值使得 $2x-5=0$ 和",
        "$3+x\\ne0$，也就是说，这时 $x$ 的值是下列等价方程组的解：",
        "$\\begin{cases}2x-5=0,\\\\↵3+x\\ne0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $2x-5=0$ 的根是 $2.5$。对于这个 $x$ 值，语句 $3+x↵\\ne0$ 变成命题 $3+2.5\\ne0$。这个命题是真命题。因而，$2.5$ 是",
        "方程组（1）的解，也就是方程 $\\frac{2x-5}{3+x}=0$ 的解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 解方程 $\\frac{x^2-2x}{x^3-x-120}+\\frac{3x}{120+x-x^3}=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将方程左边化成一个分式，得到原方程的同解方程：",
        "$\\frac{x^2-5x}{x^3-x-120}=0$。这个方程和下列方程组同解："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\begin{cases}x^2-5x=0,\\\\↵x^3-x-120\\ne0.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程 $x^2-5x=0$：",
        "$x(x-5)=0$，$x=0$ 或 $x=5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用 $0$ 和 $5$ 先后代替语句 $x^3-x-120\\ne0$ 中的 $x$，得："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
